[00:14.39]The trees were weeping in the evenings
{"暮色中树木在低泣"}
[00:19.91]while we used to pass them by
{"当我们曾从它们身旁经过"}
[00:22.67]The air was cold without that feeling
{"没有你在身边的温度"}
[00:27.39]of you there by my side
{"连空气都变得冰冷"}
[00:30.26]I try to hear the words that you say
{"我试图聆听你说过的话语"}
[00:33.71]The light you gave me isn't there
{"你给予我的光芒已消逝"}
[00:37.44]A little didn't go a long way
{"微弱的希望无法延续"}
[00:40.38]Now I see darkness everywhere
{"如今我眼中只剩黑暗"}
[00:45.72]I'm over believing
{"我不再相信了"}
[00:49.57]Cause nothing can bring you home
{"因为什么都无法带你回家"}
[00:53.22]I can't find a meaning
{"我找不到意义"}
[00:56.93]You left me without a soul
{"你带走了我全部灵魂"}
